            <ArticleTitle>[Effectiveness of modern coronary surgery].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1710-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Coronary surgery is a well established method in special cases of severe coronary heart disease. Improvement of performance as well as reduction of subjective signs, mainly angina pectoris, can be attained by aorto-coronary vein bypass operation. The lethality is today 2-4%.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
